      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Play the active Spades suit, rank 2, or any 8. You may draw one card
        and end your turn whenever Draw is shown.\n\nEvery shown action is legal:\n\u2713
        Play 10\u2660 \u2014 Matches the discard by same Spades suit.\n\u2713 Play
        4\u2660 \u2014 Matches the discard by same Spades suit.\n\u2713 Play 5\u2660
        \u2014 Matches the discard by same Spades suit.\n\u2713 Play 7\u2660 \u2014
        Matches the discard by same Spades suit.\n\u2713 Draw \u2014 Draw one card
        and end your turn; drawing is a legal choice."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
